        "generation_context_sources": [
          {
            "id": "REF-2",
            "text": "## [REF-2] How long refunds take after initiation\nRefunds go back to the original payment method. Timelines are counted in business days from the day the refund is initiated.\n\n| Payment method | Time to reach you |\n| --- | --- |\n| UPI | 1 to 3 business days |\n| Credit or debit card | 5 to 7 business days |\n| Net banking | 3 to 5 business days |\n| ZentroMart Wallet | Instant, within 2 hours |\n| Bank transfer (NEFT) for cash-on-delivery orders | 5 to 7 business days |\n| ZentroMart Wallet for cash-on-delivery orders | Instant, within 2 hours |",
            "file": "pol_refunds.md",
            "doc_type": "policy",
            "status": "current",
            "effective_from": "2026-06-15",
            "version": "2.1",
            "title": "How long refunds take after initiation"
          },
          {
            "id": "REF-3",
            "text": "## [REF-3] Cash-on-delivery refunds\nFor cash-on-delivery orders, the customer chooses either ZentroMart Wallet (instant) or a bank transfer. Bank transfers start only after the bank account details are verified, then take 5 to 7 business days.",
            "file": "pol_refunds.md",
            "doc_type": "policy",
            "status": "current",
            "effective_from": "2026-06-15",
            "version": "2.1",
            "title": "Cash-on-delivery refunds"
          },
          {
            "id": "REF-1",
            "text": "## [REF-1] When a refund is initiated\n- **Cancelled before shipping:** immediately on cancellation.\n- **Returned item:** after the item passes quality check, within 2 business days of pickup. ZentroMart Plus members: at pickup.\n- **Prepaid order refused at the door or not delivered after 3 attempts:** once the parcel reaches the warehouse, usually 7 to 10 calendar days after the last delivery attempt.",
            "file": "pol_refunds.md",
            "doc_type": "policy",
            "status": "current",
            "effective_from": "2026-06-15",
            "version": "2.1",
            "title": "When a refund is initiated"
          },
          {
            "id": "RET-7",
            "text": "## [RET-7] After pickup\nReturned items go through a quality check (QC) at the warehouse. The refund is initiated within 2 business days of pickup once the item passes QC. For ZentroMart Plus members, the refund is initiated at the time of pickup. Refund timelines after initiation are in the Refunds policy.",
            "file": "pol_returns_v4.md",
            "doc_type": "policy",
            "status": "current",
            "effective_from": "2026-08-01",
            "version": "4.0",
            "title": "After pickup"
          },
          {
            "id": "PAY-4",
            "text": "## [PAY-4] ZentroMart Wallet\nZentroMart Wallet balance can be used on any order and never expires. It cannot be transferred to a bank account. For cash-on-delivery refunds, the customer chooses Wallet or bank transfer before the refund is made (REF-3); once refunded to the Wallet, it stays there.",
            "file": "pol_payments_cod.md",
            "doc_type": "policy",
            "status": "current",
            "effective_from": "2026-04-01",
            "version": "1.6",
            "title": "ZentroMart Wallet"
          },
          {
            "id": "REF-6",
            "text": "## [REF-6] Refund reference number\nEvery initiated refund has a refund reference number (RRN) that the customer's bank can trace. Share it when a customer says the money has not arrived.",
            "file": "pol_refunds.md",
            "doc_type": "policy",
            "status": "current",
            "effective_from": "2026-06-15",
            "version": "2.1",
            "title": "Refund reference number"
          },
          {
            "id": "MKS-2",
            "text": "## [MKS-2] Returns and refunds\nReturn windows, reverse pickup and refunds are the same for every seller and are handled by ZentroMart.",
            "file": "pol_marketplace_sellers.md",
            "doc_type": "policy",
            "status": "current",
            "effective_from": "2026-03-01",
            "version": "1.0",
            "title": "Returns and refunds"
          },
          {
            "id": "DEL-4",
            "text": "## [DEL-4] Late deliveries\nIf an **Express** order arrives after its promised date, the ₹79 express fee the customer paid is credited to ZentroMart Wallet automatically within 48 hours. ZentroMart Plus members, who pay no express fee, get no credit. There is no compensation for late Standard deliveries. Agents must not offer any other compensation.",
            "file": "pol_delivery_shipping.md",
            "doc_type": "policy",
            "status": "current",
            "effective_from": "2026-04-01",
            "version": "2.0",
            "title": "Late deliveries"
          },
          {
            "id": "PLS-2",
            "text": "## [PLS-2] Benefits\n- Free Express delivery where Express is available.\n- No reverse pickup fee on any return.\n- Refunds on returns are initiated at pickup, without waiting for quality check.\n\nZentroMart Plus does **not** change return windows, return eligibility or refund timelines after initiation.",
            "file": "pol_plus_membership.md",
            "doc_type": "policy",
            "status": "current",
            "effective_from": "2026-01-01",
            "version": "1.0",
            "title": "Benefits"
          },
          {
            "id": "REF-4",
            "text": "## [REF-4] Partial refunds and coupons\nIf part of an order is returned, the refund is the price paid for that item after its share of any coupon discount. If the remaining order falls below the coupon's minimum order value, the coupon discount on the remaining items is deducted from the refund.",
            "file": "pol_refunds.md",
            "doc_type": "policy",
            "status": "current",
            "effective_from": "2026-06-15",
            "version": "2.1",
            "title": "Partial refunds and coupons"
          },
          {
            "id": "CAN-2",
            "text": "## [CAN-2] After the order ships\nA shipped order cannot be cancelled. The customer can:\n- refuse the parcel at the door. For cash-on-delivery orders nothing is charged. For prepaid orders the refund follows REF-1 once the parcel returns to the warehouse; or\n- accept the delivery and return the item within its return window, if the category is returnable.",
            "file": "pol_cancellations.md",
            "doc_type": "policy",
            "status": "current",
            "effective_from": "2026-05-01",
            "version": "1.4",
            "title": "After the order ships"
          },
          {
            "id": "KB-00.3",
            "text": "## [KB-00.3] Business days\nA business day is Monday to Saturday, excluding the warehouse holidays below. Refund and logistics timelines are counted in business days. Return windows are counted in calendar days.\n\n| Date | Holiday |\n| --- | --- |\n| 2026-08-15 | Independence Day |\n| 2026-10-02 | Gandhi Jayanti |\n| 2026-10-19 | Warehouse closure (festival) |\n| 2026-11-09 | Warehouse closure (festival) |",
            "file": "00_about_this_knowledge_base.md",
            "doc_type": "meta",
            "status": "current",
            "effective_from": "2026-08-01",
            "version": "1.2",
            "title": "Business days"
          },
          {
            "id": "DEL-3",
            "text": "## [DEL-3] Delivery attempts\nThe courier makes up to 3 delivery attempts. After a failed attempt the customer gets an SMS to reschedule. If the third attempt fails, the parcel is returned to the warehouse (return to origin, RTO) and REF-1 applies.",
            "file": "pol_delivery_shipping.md",
            "doc_type": "policy",
            "status": "current",
            "effective_from": "2026-04-01",
            "version": "2.0",
            "title": "Delivery attempts"
          }
        ],
